{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command. Conquer. Dominate.</strong><br>In <strong>Empire\u2019s Supreme Command</strong>, every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This deep turn-based strategy and empire-building game lets your tactical decisions shape the fate of your nation. Plan your path to victory through diplomacy, technology, espionage, and warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>3 engaging maps</strong> and explore the core mechanics of empire management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a taste of strategic depth with limited spy, war, and diplomacy options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Version Unlocks Everything:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All difficulty levels</strong> for the ultimate challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded unit upgrades</strong>: Extra movement, extra attack, and remove general/admiral turn cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: Change the appearance of generals and admirals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced espionage options</strong>: Disrupt Communication, Bribe Generals, Steal Money, Frame a Country, Rig Elections, Infiltrate War Rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic warfare options</strong>: Commando Attacks, Deep Sea Operations, Stealth Attacks, Operation Blackjack, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many new maps</strong>: Vast battlefields from sprawling continents to coastal and naval theaters, supporting more players, alliances, and endless strategic possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the demo for a spin\u2026 then <strong>unlock the full arsenal of strategic possibilities</strong> in the full version on Steam.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com