be Generals, Steal Money, Frame a Country, Rig Elections, Infiltrate War Rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic warfare options</strong>: Commando Attacks, Deep Sea Operations, Stealth Attacks, Operation Blackjack, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many new maps</strong>: Vast battlefields from sprawling continents to coastal and naval theaters, supporting more players, alliances, and endless strategic possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the demo for a spin\u2026 then <strong>unlock the full arsenal of strategic possibilities</strong> in the full version on Steam.</p>","developers":["iGindisGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3991280","name":"Empire\u2019s Supreme Command"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106250/698651a94e7b2a103f86bbf8df7c12d8b6ebec2b/header.jpg?t=1761110525","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 iGindis all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106250/1972390739/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1760284758/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761110523","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106250/1972390739/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1760284758/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761110523","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106250/1972390739/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1760284758/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761110523","id":257216498,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216498/movie480.mp4?t=1761110523","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216498/movie_max.mp4?t=1761110523"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste